# Experiment outputs (W10) — tracked via git tags + summary cards, not raw artifacts
data/v4_model/experiments/

# Trained model binaries — large + user-local; rebuild via nutmeg-train
data/v4_model/
data/v4_model_cat/
data/v4_model_cat_lineups/
# 🚨 2026-09-15 —— 换盘时发现:上面三行是**精确目录名**,而备份/退役盘叫
# `data/v4_model_cat.bak-<ts>-<why>/`、`data/v4_model_cat.superseded-<ts>/`
# ⇒ 当时有 **4 个 artifact 目录**在这个**公开仓库**里既未忽略也未提交。
# 从没漏出去(一直是 `??`),但一次 `git add -A` 就会把 booster 二进制推上公网。
# ⇒ 按前缀收口,不再逐个目录名维护(同「写死名单的护栏会悄悄失效」)。
data/v4_model*/

# Local SQLite databases (observation layer, dev only)
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# data_freshness sentinel heartbeat (体检 P0-2 — written every run, watched by vote cron)
data/.data_freshness_heartbeat

